      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRING IT (2) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (30.04) at this track behind Buckle Up Sky in a Grade 4. Has the pace to be prominent. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from six attempts. Can measure up this time. GET ON BOARD (1) doesn't win out of turn. Finished in the money last time though when third (30.35) at this track. Winning chance. NEPTUNE FIREBALL (4) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by 5 lengths at this track in a handy 30.29 beating Mighty Murphy. Can make it back-to-back wins. ROSIES RETURN (6) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
